; A lot written with its valuation spelled out, {$5} [2020/01/01] (($7)),
; and the same lot written plainly and then given that valuation by the
; `value` of an account holding it (AAPL, MSFT) or by a Value:: tag (VTI:
; $70 for 10 units, $7 a unit) are one lot.  The balance assertions on
; Assets:Broker pass whether they name the lot with its valuation or
; without; the automated transaction that mirrors Assets:Fund into
; Assets:Tracked, whose `value` reaches the lot, balances; and each
; account holds its shares as a single lot, which -V values at $7 a unit,
; Assets:Fund and Assets:Plain included, though neither gives the lot a
; valuation.
;
; The valuation Ledger gives the plainly written lot goes to the lot
; itself, which every amount of it shares, and gives it exactly the
; annotations of the lot written with its valuation, so Ledger counts
; the two as one lot.  3.4.1 stopped at the first assertion, as it
; checked balance assertions against the account's holdings stripped of
; their lot annotations (#2318, #2355).  Without the assertions it
; balanced the automated transaction and kept each AAPL and MSFT holding
; as one lot, but it read the Value:: tag's $70 as $70 a unit (#2399),
; so Assets:Tagged held two VTI lots and -V valued Assets:Plain at $700.

account Assets:Broker
    value $7

account Assets:Tracked
    value $7

= /^Assets:Fund/
    Assets:Tracked       1
    Equity:Tracked      -1

2020/01/01 Buy, valuation written out
    Assets:Broker     10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] (($7))
    Assets:Cash      $-50

2020/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker     10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01]
    Assets:Cash      $-50

2020/01/01 Check
    Assets:Broker     0 AAPL = 20 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01]
    Assets:Broker     0 AAPL = 20 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] (($7))

2020/01/01 Buy, valuation written out
    Assets:Tracked    10 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01] (($7))
    Assets:Cash      $-50

2020/01/01 Opening balance
    Assets:Fund       10 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01]
    Equity:Opening

2020/01/01 Buy, valuation written out
    Assets:Tagged     10 VTI {$5} [2020/01/01] (($7))
    Assets:Cash      $-50

2020/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Tagged     10 VTI {$5} [2020/01/01]  ; Value:: $70
    Assets:Cash      $-50

2020/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Plain      10 VTI {$5} [2020/01/01]
    Assets:Cash      $-50

test bal --lots --flat
20 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Assets:Broker
               $-300  Assets:Cash
10 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Assets:Fund
10 VTI {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Assets:Plain
20 VTI {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Assets:Tagged
20 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Assets:Tracked
-10 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Equity:Opening
-10 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))  Equity:Tracked
--------------------
                             $-300
20 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))
10 MSFT {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))
 30 VTI {$5} [2020/01/01] (({$7}))
end test

test bal -V --flat
                $140  Assets:Broker
               $-300  Assets:Cash
                 $70  Assets:Fund
                 $70  Assets:Plain
                $140  Assets:Tagged
                $140  Assets:Tracked
                $-70  Equity:Opening
                $-70  Equity:Tracked
--------------------
                $120
end test
